      "nsfw": true,
      "requiresHost": [
        "picacomic.account.v3"
      ],
      "hostRequirements": "Native PicacomicJsSource secure account/signing gateway and system secure storage. Requires Triomi iOS181 (0.12.0+181) or a successor declaring picacomic.account.v3, which sends the reference protocol empty Authorization header on sign-in and safely classifies HTTP 400 responses. Host179/180 are unsupported by rule 1.0.4. Initial native implementation: 67ce2cd4b9b9c0a87dcf556d0eb3aa9951634da2. Legacy clients ignore requiresHost; update the application before installing this rule. Rule 1.0.4 only fixes single-page catalog pagination; full episode/image traversal retains the 200-page and 20,000-item budgets. Authorized account acceptance through host181 production login and category path passed; real JS catalog, detail, images and reading remain unverified."
    },
